    <bpmn:process id="W_W4758" name="W4758. Vehicle Handover, Time-and-Mileage Capture &amp; Yard Loading Coordination" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Agreement signed (W4755), deposit held (W4756), LDW elected (W4757)
Frequency: Per rental
Volume: Every rental (~800–1,200/month)
Owner: Rental Counter Associate / Yard (VS-07.1)
Participants: Customer, Yard Dispatch (VS-07.1 W438), LP (VS-23)
Source: workflow W4758 — Vehicle Handover, Time-and-Mileage Capture &amp; Yard Loading Coordination</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4758_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4758_Lane1" name="Rental Counter Associate">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4758_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4758_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4758_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4758_Lane2" name="Yard">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4758_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4758_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4758_Start4" name="Agreement signed (W4755), deposit held (W4756), LDW elected (W4757)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4758_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4758_Task5" name="Capture the checkout baseline: odometer reading, fuel level, date/time, and a…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Capture the checkout baseline: odometer reading, fuel level, date/time, and a pre-rental condition photoset (exterior + interior + cargo area + fuel gauge) timestamped to telematics (W4749); confirm CR/plate/CTPL valid (release gate from W4747) and between-rental safety check passed (W4750)
Responsible (R): Rental Counter Associate / Yard
Accountable (A): Rental Counter Supervisor
Duration: 5–8 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4758_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4758_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4758_Task6" name="Walk the customer around the vehicle to confirm condition matches the photoset…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Walk the customer around the vehicle to confirm condition matches the photoset, demonstrate controls/tie-downs/spare/jack/fire-extinguisher/first-aid, brief on geofence/curfew (W4749) and fuel-return policy; this is the condition baseline for the return inspection (W4759)
Responsible (R): Rental Counter Associate / Yard
Accountable (A): Rental Counter Supervisor
Duration: 5–8 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4758_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4758_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4758_Task7" name="Coordinate yard loading (VS-07.1 W438 / W1281) of the customer&#x27;s purchased…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Coordinate yard loading (VS-07.1 W438 / W1281) of the customer&#x27;s purchased merchandise into the rented vehicle — forklift/load-assist for lumber/cement/tile/appliances, proper tie-down per W4746 spec, and payload check (no overloading); release the vehicle on telematics to start time-and-mileage billing
Responsible (R): Yard / Rental Counter
Accountable (A): Rental Counter Supervisor / Yard Lead
Duration: 5–15 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4758_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4758_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4758_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4758_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4758_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-717 (ensure controlled execution — Rental Transaction, Counter Operations &amp; Customer Onboarding (PA-162.2).) | - CTL-717: checkout photoset + CR/CTPL/safety-check gate before release; payload &amp; tie-down verified at yard loading
Owner: Rental Counter Associate / Yard (VS-07.1)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
